WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:17.870
<i>hoshi ga furishikiru penthouse de
In the penthouse that watches the stars fall...</i>

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>sora no ORUGO-RU hitori kiiteta
I listened to Heaven's music box...</i>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:30.460
<i>GARASU no RO-PU wo mekakushi de wataru
Walking, blindfolded, across a tight-rope of glass...</i>

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:37.090
<i>minna sabishii SA-KASU no kodomo sa
Everyone is like, the lonely child of the circus.</i>

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:45.020
<i>hitori bocchi no kanashimi ni
The rope that creaks with the sadness of isolation...</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.770
<i>kishinda tsuna ga kokoro de yureteru...
...is still locked deep in my heart...</i>

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>yasashii me wo shita dareka ni aitai
I wish to meet the one who's eyes glow with warmth!</i>

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:25.980
<i>sasayaite kureyo soba ni iruyotte Silent Voice
Whisper to me that you'll always be there by my side, Silent Voice.</i>

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:35.830
Roux's left the Argama.

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:38.300
She didn't really intend to run away.

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:44.130
But in a fight with Glemy's mobile suit forces,
which were attacking a Karaba base,

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:46.390
Beecha and Mondo went a bit too far.

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:50.320
Nobody wants to be used as a shield
during a mobile suit battle.

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:55.990
Once the fighting was over,
Roux abandoned the Argama.

00:01:57.290 --> 00:02:01.400
BLUE TEAM

00:01:57.290 --> 00:02:01.400
(Part 1)

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:29.230
That's the city of Ghardaïa.

00:02:29.230 --> 00:02:32.020
It would be nice if I could
get some oil there.

00:02:42.460 --> 00:02:46.610
To think we've let someone like Haman
claim the name of Neo Zeon.

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:52.490
The teachings of Zeon Zum Deikun...

00:02:52.850 --> 00:02:55.630
were implemented by Degwin Zabi.

00:02:56.180 --> 00:03:01.800
In the year U.C. 0065,
the Principality of Zeon was born.

00:03:02.650 --> 00:03:06.520
The One Year War
began in U.C. 0079,

00:03:07.690 --> 00:03:12.560
and Degwin Zabi was killed,
but his will...

00:03:14.490 --> 00:03:17.530
His... will...

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:24.940
A-A Zaku Tanker and Zakus!

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:26.860
And...

00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:34.380
They've come to pick me up!

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:52.640
This is a Neo Zeon uniform.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:54.680
What's he doing here?

00:03:54.680 --> 00:03:58.810
Who knows? But he may be of use to us.

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:05.030
Why do you need ID
to enter a free city?!

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:07.240
This is no longer the old Ghardaïa!

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:08.860
That's absurd!

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:11.700
Guys from the African independence
movement are running around!

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:13.740
And there's nothing as
scary as a female spy.

00:04:13.740 --> 00:04:15.700
I'm not involved with any of that!

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:18.580
- You can't!
- I'm not a spy!

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:20.330
Would a spy admit that she's a spy?

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:22.060
I have a friend here!

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:24.920
Then tell us his name!

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:28.510
- T-That's...
- So what's his name, eh?

00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:28.970
W-Well...

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:31.970
I knew it! You're just making things up!

00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:33.260
Honey!

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:36.810
You're so late! I got in trouble
because I forgot my ID!

00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:38.230
Sorry 'bout this.

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:38.980
That's enough!

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:41.190
I'm sorry, Mr. Genet, this woman--

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:44.660
Genet! Tell them all about
our relationship!

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:47.900
I've made up my mind!
I don't care if people know.

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:49.700
Marianne! It's your fault!

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:50.950
I'm sorry!

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:54.910
I'll vouch for this woman's identity.
Sorry to have troubled you!

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:55.870
But wait--

00:04:55.870 --> 00:04:57.620
I was a bit too tough on you.

00:04:57.620 --> 00:04:58.910
I'm sorry, Marianne.

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:00.090
Oh, honey.

00:05:00.470 --> 00:05:03.080
I'd like to believe
it 'cause it's Mr. Genet.

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:04.630
But how many girlfriends?

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:05.760
Beats me.

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:08.920
I'm so sorry. You were a lifesaver.

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:10.720
Same goes for me!

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:13.490
I've been looking for
inspiration for my art.

00:05:13.490 --> 00:05:15.870
That's why I helped you!

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:19.360
That's right! YOU!
You're a work of art!

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:22.100
W-Wait a minute... Do you want
me to take my clothes off?

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:25.020
The nude is not the only
form of art, you amateur!

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:26.610
B-But normally--

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:29.360
I am not normal. I am a genius!

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:30.620
Oh, brother.

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:31.900
Come with me!

00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:32.950
To where?

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:34.910
To join the other Franks.

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:36.160
Franks?

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:41.760
That's what the people around here call
us Europeans, to show their disdain.

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:48.130
No! I want to take a bath!

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:51.300
Jeez! With Roux gone,
so much work is piling up.

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:54.800
I can't stand it if you're
next to me squawking all day!

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:57.360
It's all Beecha's fault
that Roux is gone!

00:05:57.360 --> 00:05:59.260
Oh, trust me. I know that!

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:01.060
Because you were such a jerk to Roux...

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:03.820
Now I have to be a babysitter
on top of everything else!

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:06.540
Yeah, go ahead, treat
me like the bad guy...

00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:09.790
But you've always thought we'd be
better off without Roux around!

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:12.360
T-That... that's not true!

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:13.320
WATER!

00:06:13.530 --> 00:06:15.380
I know you, Elle!

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:18.240
I got rid of Roux so
you wouldn't have to.

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:21.160
Jeez, what a self-centered-- what?!

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:23.370
This isn't water!

00:06:23.370 --> 00:06:26.120
Of course not! Who'd wash
machines with water?

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:27.560
Stop that!

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:29.970
Stop it, Ple!

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:31.840
That girl...!

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:34.180
My body is all slimy now.

00:06:35.190 --> 00:06:38.470
Qum, Shinta! Hurry up and
shut off the main oil valve!

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:40.100
What?

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:42.610
The main valve! The main valve!

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:47.600
At this rate, we'll run out of it before
we catch up with the Audhumla.

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:51.330
Hose up all the oil.
We'll need to recycle it.

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:52.940
Got it!

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:55.740
Why are you using so much cleaning oil?

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:58.530
It's the desert sand. We need
twice as much as in space.

00:06:58.530 --> 00:07:01.030
We have to resupply somewhere.

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:03.160
Roux was in charge of
keeping up with that.

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:04.580
What are you trying to say?

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:09.470
Well, nothing in particular... But we
never used to have this problem.

00:07:11.980 --> 00:07:14.010
- H-Here?
- Please.

00:07:14.170 --> 00:07:17.260
This is going to be something
perverted after all, isn't it?

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:18.760
If it was, what would you do?

00:07:18.760 --> 00:07:22.810
Don't think I'm just like
all those other girls.

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:25.440
Oh, I love a woman
who plays hard to get!

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:27.890
Stop it!

00:07:27.890 --> 00:07:30.190
There's an escalator here?

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:32.820
There's something even more
interesting downstairs!

00:07:32.820 --> 00:07:34.400
Interesting?

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:35.280
Yeah!

00:07:45.180 --> 00:07:46.430
Ple!

00:07:46.430 --> 00:07:50.220
Captain! Can we stop off at Ghardaïa?

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:53.050
But I wanted to keep heading north.

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:54.750
We're behind schedule.

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:56.420
Let's stop for supplies.

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:58.760
That way, maybe Roux can catch up to us.

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:00.840
Oh, but... uh...

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:03.150
NO! Judau is--

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:06.020
Got you! I'm gonna
give you a spanking!

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:07.270
Elle!

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:10.990
Ple... why shouldn't we
go to Ghardaïa?

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:12.610
Because Roux...

00:08:12.610 --> 00:08:13.940
What about Roux?

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:16.710
Nothing! Nothing at all!

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:18.530
So Roux is there right now?

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:19.570
I don't know!

00:08:19.570 --> 00:08:21.030
Captain!

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:23.870
- Judau!
- I'm going to replenish our oil supply!

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:26.620
- Judau!
- Me, too!

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:28.290
Iino! Get the Dodai Kai!

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:29.830
Sure!

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:32.170
Is this okay, Captain?

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:34.180
Resupplying was your idea.

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:38.350
- Don't fall behind!
- I know that!

00:08:48.830 --> 00:08:51.310
- What are you doing?!
- Were you going without me?!

00:08:51.310 --> 00:08:52.400
And you call yourself a girl?

00:08:52.560 --> 00:08:54.360
Go, go!

00:09:04.380 --> 00:09:07.920
Really... is there an underground
city in a place like this?

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:20.270
I-Is this the entrance?

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:25.940
So far, it's just as I was told...

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:30.900
But still, why do I have
to obey them...?

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:36.730
A Frank like you will be able to enter
Ghardaïa just by showing your pass!

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:41.570
Once you're in the underground city,
find the city's control room! Got that?

00:09:41.570 --> 00:09:47.100
- W-Why should I?
- We are the Blue Corps of the
African Independence Front!

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:48.370
T-The Blue Corps...?

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:53.250
We're fighting to reclaim Ghardaïa,
which has been taken over by Franks.

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:56.250
You'll sneak into the underground city
as our vanguard,

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:58.760
and find the control room!

00:09:59.150 --> 00:10:04.180
If you can do that, we'll believe
that you're really with Neo Zeon!

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:06.970
F-Fine.

00:10:06.970 --> 00:10:13.110
No, I must stomach it...
I must return to space!

00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:26.830
Isn't that... Roux?!

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:29.780
The usual. What about you?

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:31.290
I'll have what he's having.

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:33.600
This feels like an old movie, doesn't it?

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:38.670
However much science advances,
human desires never change.

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:40.550
Not even if people
become Newtypes.

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:41.880
Is that so?

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:43.460
Of course it is.

00:10:43.460 --> 00:10:48.220
What people need is beauty like yours,
and the love of fellow humans.

00:10:48.220 --> 00:10:50.980
Right now, you're seeking that, too.

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:54.140
M-Maybe so.

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:56.280
Yes, it's so.

00:10:59.580 --> 00:11:03.660
That man... what is he doing to Roux?!

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:10.330
Roux, you must be
tired from your long trip.

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:13.840
Once we've eaten, let's go somewhere
where you can relax and rest.

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:16.670
You womanizer!

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:18.290
Oh no!

00:11:18.290 --> 00:11:20.290
M-Mr. Glemy?

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:22.650
I-Is he a friend of yours?

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:27.410
Mr. Genet! There are some things
you should never say, even in jest!

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:29.840
Miss Roux, you can't mean that!

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:32.720
For us to meet in a place like this,
is it not divine guidance?

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:34.340
This is our destiny!

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:35.560
That's a mouthful!

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:36.940
Miss Roux!

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:40.740
That's enough! Can't you see
you're frightening her?

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:44.280
How dare you!

00:11:44.280 --> 00:11:45.490
Damn you!

00:11:45.880 --> 00:11:47.580
Stop it, Glemy! June!

00:11:49.090 --> 00:11:50.880
What a hard head!

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:55.710
Don't underestimate me just because
I'm an artist, young man.

00:11:56.970 --> 00:12:00.170
Now, come with me, Roux!

00:12:00.520 --> 00:12:01.580
Where are we going?!

00:12:22.120 --> 00:12:23.480
So late!

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:25.780
Don't you think that
Glemy guy is a bit late?

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:28.440
Dido! Maybe he ran off somewhere!

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:29.900
Don't fret, Elo.

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:33.050
Glemy's only just entered Ghardaïa.

00:12:33.050 --> 00:12:35.620
He's already forgotten that
we saved him in the desert.

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:39.120
It was a mistake to bring a space jerk
like him into the Blue Corps.

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:41.500
Glemy is an officer of Neo Zeon.

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:44.890
It was Neo Zeon's activity that
spurred Gadeb Jasin into action.

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:47.170
That means Glemy will be of use to us.

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:48.380
Commander!

00:12:48.380 --> 00:12:53.640
In our veins flows the blood of the Tuareg,
who upheld the honor of Africa!

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:55.700
Our mobile suits are blue for a reason!

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:59.640
Gadeb Jasin wants to raise an army
of African independence!

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:04.200
I know what Gadeb wants, but what if
Glemy turns out to be a Frankish spy?

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:09.160
He figured out our Zakus and Gelgoogs
were replicas just by looking at them!

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:11.200
That's true. He's no ordinary man.

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:14.070
That's why I believed him when
he said he was with Neo Zeon.

00:13:14.070 --> 00:13:18.930
We can't recapture Ghardaïa without
information about the underground city.

00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:21.290
- But...
- Commander!

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:25.380
The scouting EWAC Zack found
machines heading for Ghardaïa!

00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:26.290
What?!

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:27.730
The data's coming in!

00:13:27.730 --> 00:13:30.920
Judging from the direction and their numbers,
they're not part of Gadeb Jasin's forces!

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:32.630
They're enemies, come
to support that man!

00:13:32.800 --> 00:13:35.680
No. In that case, they wouldn't
have come so soon.

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:36.800
I'm going out.

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:39.100
Don't act rashly
before Gadeb Jasin arrives.

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:40.530
I know!

00:13:40.530 --> 00:13:42.100
Elo...

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:44.850
Zaku Tanker! Keep the engine running!

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:46.280
Yes, sir!

00:13:52.210 --> 00:13:54.610
I'm sticky all over! I feel disgusting!

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:57.030
There's nothing to be done.
We can't use any water.

00:13:57.030 --> 00:13:58.530
Come on, I want a bath!

00:13:58.530 --> 00:14:00.460
Don't pester me so much!

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:04.500
What's the commotion?
Is there something down there?

00:14:04.500 --> 00:14:07.010
The city of Ghardaïa
is built in a basin.

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:11.090
I feel something weird.

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:12.760
Because you're covered in oil, right?

00:14:12.760 --> 00:14:14.430
That's not what I mean!

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:16.350
Hey, a town!

00:14:22.560 --> 00:14:23.770
What's that?

00:14:23.770 --> 00:14:24.900
I don't know!

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:28.730
Did it launch from Ghardaïa?

00:14:28.730 --> 00:14:30.200
How could such a thing happen?

00:14:31.710 --> 00:14:33.440
You, from Ghardaïa!

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:36.120
We aren't hostiles!
We didn't come here to fight!

00:14:36.510 --> 00:14:38.090
That won't work!

00:14:38.090 --> 00:14:41.290
All the more reason why we
can't let you into Ghardaïa!

00:14:42.760 --> 00:14:44.210
What?!

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:46.880
Judau, don't you get it? He's an enemy!

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:51.140
Like that would hit me!
You're going down!

00:14:52.860 --> 00:14:54.300
Elle! Iino!

00:14:54.300 --> 00:14:57.470
I'm fine. That was just
the shield blowing off!

00:14:57.470 --> 00:15:00.180
I guess we have no choice but to fight.

00:15:00.180 --> 00:15:03.150
I don't think they even know
their own fighting strength.

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:09.360
The machine gun!

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:11.020
Base Jabber, go after the other one!

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:11.690
Yes, sir!

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:13.530
Even without a machine gun...!

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:17.560
We're falling!

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:20.000
- Judau!
- Elle! Above you!

00:15:27.020 --> 00:15:28.370
Ple, are you all right?!

00:15:28.370 --> 00:15:29.750
I'm fine!

00:15:29.750 --> 00:15:31.720
So damn persistent!

00:15:36.190 --> 00:15:39.190
What are you? Zeon? Axis?

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:43.230
I'm nothing so vulgar!
I'm from the Blue Corps!

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:51.750
I need to know your true
feelings, Miss Roux Louka.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:55.470
It's not my fault you
happened to fall for me, is it?

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:58.780
I am a man who could
be ruler of all Neo Zeon.

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:00.160
If you join together with me...

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:04.290
I like your confidence,
but women aren't that simple.

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:05.010
What's that?

00:16:05.010 --> 00:16:07.410
Looks like lights from a battle.

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:10.480
Mobile suits! It's a mobile suit battle!

00:16:10.480 --> 00:16:13.880
The Blue Corps is fighting?
Who's the enemy?

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:15.090
You're not the real deal.

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:16.460
What?

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:20.220
You got distracted by a fight when you
were in the middle of wooing a lady.

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:22.690
Stuff like that really pisses me off.

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:25.650
Miss Roux Louka.

00:16:29.910 --> 00:16:30.940
We did it!

00:16:30.940 --> 00:16:32.450
No, not quite!

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:37.160
It's doing pretty well
for such an old model!

00:16:41.010 --> 00:16:42.540
Did we get that one?

00:16:43.340 --> 00:16:44.920
It's coming! To your right!

00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:52.170
- Not bad!
- Judau!

00:16:56.350 --> 00:16:58.680
Dammit, he got the beam rifle!

00:17:01.990 --> 00:17:03.220
Pretty tough, huh?

00:17:03.220 --> 00:17:04.550
He's very spirited.

00:17:04.550 --> 00:17:06.660
Why is he like this?
He's just a normal human.

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:09.440
Here goes! On the honor
of our Tuareg blood!

00:17:18.540 --> 00:17:19.950
What?!

00:17:21.860 --> 00:17:24.750
Judau! You're in danger!

00:17:27.430 --> 00:17:30.380
- See!
- I knew they wouldn't attack alone.

00:17:31.060 --> 00:17:34.060
Elo! You're doing too much alone!
Look at the enemy!

00:17:34.060 --> 00:17:36.220
- Commander!
- The rifle!

00:17:45.030 --> 00:17:47.350
Where did that mobile suit go?

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:52.640
- The Base Jabber is in trouble!
- What?

00:17:52.640 --> 00:17:56.950
You could jump that high with
the Zaku's propellant tanks.

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:00.860
That's a Gundam.

00:18:00.860 --> 00:18:03.080
It has to be a Gundam.

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:07.990
That's an old mobile suit, isn't it?

00:18:07.990 --> 00:18:11.500
But the insides are different.
It's been modified.

00:18:12.180 --> 00:18:15.090
It's pretty tough without a rifle.

00:18:20.980 --> 00:18:23.220
Gadeb Jasin's army is coming.

00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:25.380
Will we be safe if we
evacuate underground?

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:27.930
They came over here without a plan
because they wanted some oil.

00:18:27.930 --> 00:18:29.060
They're helpless without me.

00:18:29.060 --> 00:18:30.440
Mademoiselle!

00:18:31.570 --> 00:18:33.850
Miss Roux, head underground.
It's too dangerous.

00:18:33.850 --> 00:18:34.810
I don't think so.

00:18:34.810 --> 00:18:38.500
When Gadeb's army comes in,
this city will become a battlefield.

00:18:38.500 --> 00:18:42.570
I'm not gonna be a security blanket
for some cowardly man!

00:18:42.740 --> 00:18:45.910
Roux... I know you're
a lonely person, too.

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:46.990
It's written across your back.

00:18:47.220 --> 00:18:51.500
You should never...
underestimate a woman!

00:18:52.850 --> 00:18:54.170
Miss Roux!

00:18:54.720 --> 00:18:56.380
Roux.

00:19:00.400 --> 00:19:01.920
That was Roux!

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:11.480
All right, with this--

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:23.030
It's gonna hit us!

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:24.990
I'm gonna dive into that crag!

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:31.500
Do you think you're hiding?

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:33.870
Hold this position!

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:38.150
We'll lose cover in three, two, one...!

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:39.380
Got it!

00:19:45.050 --> 00:19:46.470
All right!

00:19:46.470 --> 00:19:47.730
Where's Judau?!

00:19:49.150 --> 00:19:51.530
That's the Zeta Gundam?!

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:55.520
Damn those people on the Argama,
making Roux into a spy.

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:07.130
But... I can't let them
defeat the Blue Corps!

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:08.950
I won't let you defeat Judau!

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:10.120
What?

00:20:12.840 --> 00:20:15.270
For the freedom of Africa!

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:18.460
W-What is this feeling?!

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:23.220
I won't allow it!

00:20:24.650 --> 00:20:27.100
I-It evaded that shot?!

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:30.730
Judau!

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:32.680
They got Elo?

00:20:32.850 --> 00:20:35.150
Elle! Iino!

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:47.650
- Judau!
- Are you all right?

00:20:47.650 --> 00:20:49.570
- Yeah, I'm fine!
- Look out!

00:20:54.340 --> 00:20:56.540
If only I had a mobile suit!

00:20:56.970 --> 00:20:58.800
Talk about trying hard!

00:20:59.680 --> 00:21:01.370
That's Glemy!

00:21:01.370 --> 00:21:02.460
Glemy?

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:03.960
Got it! Retreat!

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:06.220
The enemy has no mobile suits
left that can jump!

00:21:11.610 --> 00:21:14.480
The Gundam Team is retreating?

00:21:15.070 --> 00:21:17.610
I guess I worried
about them for nothing.

00:21:21.830 --> 00:21:25.520
The mobile suits that attacked us...
who in the world were they?

00:21:25.520 --> 00:21:27.670
And that weird feeling...

00:21:27.670 --> 00:21:30.860
Judau, Roux is in Ghardaïa.

00:21:30.860 --> 00:21:32.410
You sensed Roux?

00:21:32.410 --> 00:21:33.170
Yeah.

00:21:33.170 --> 00:21:38.130
Judau, let's drop the mobile suits off
near the city and enter Ghardaïa on foot.

00:21:38.130 --> 00:21:40.580
I'm sure Roux made an emergency
landing somewhere around here!

00:21:40.790 --> 00:21:42.670
Roger, let's go do that!

00:21:42.670 --> 00:21:44.010
Roger!

00:21:52.820 --> 00:21:54.800
Dido, hang on!

00:21:54.800 --> 00:21:56.950
If only I hadn't acted so rashly.

00:21:56.950 --> 00:22:01.400
No, Elo... you are a
brave Tuareg warrior.

00:22:01.400 --> 00:22:02.980
G-Glemy.

00:22:02.980 --> 00:22:05.810
Don't speak any more, Dido.
It will aggravate your wounds.

00:22:05.810 --> 00:22:07.610
Let me tell you this.

00:22:07.610 --> 00:22:09.910
I'm impressed that you came, Glemy.

00:22:09.910 --> 00:22:13.530
You aren't a Neo Zeon officer for nothing.

00:22:13.530 --> 00:22:17.930
Glemy... I have one
last favor to ask of you.

00:22:17.930 --> 00:22:22.500
Fight for the honor of
the Blue Corps, Glemy.

00:22:24.930 --> 00:22:26.310
I'll do that.

00:22:26.310 --> 00:22:28.140
I'm relying on you.

00:22:30.230 --> 00:22:31.720
Dido!

00:22:32.980 --> 00:22:35.480
DIDO!

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:50.820
<i>ikuyaku ikuman ikuoku no hoshi yo
Hundreds upon thousands upon millions of stars...</i>

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:56.950
<i>naze hikaru dake nano ka kataru chikara no shiwase
...why do you just sit there and twinkle? Show me the power that lets me connect!</i>

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>Ima nara ore demo furikaerasu ni tobitatsu kokoro
For now, even I've got a mind that wanders without reminiscing past regrets!</i>

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:13.930
<i>Hoshi no kazu dake inochi wo takuwareba
If lives are really stored in the form of stars...</i>

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:19.940
<i>ginga no mure no hikari wo kaete misero
...show me how to change the light and move galaxies...</i>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:29.650
<i>kono te ga tsukamu inochi no omosa ni naru
The weight of life itself, will be held in my hands!</i>

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:35.530
<i>mada meinai yo sora no michishirude wa
Space's guidepost is still not within my sights...</i>

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:41.620
<i>kono te ni saware hikari isenmanen
Let the light of 10 million years touch this hand!</i>

00:23:45.850 --> 00:23:50.400
So I kinda wasted our time trying to
choose between Roux and the Core Fighter.

00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:53.530
But it wasn't long before
things got serious.

00:23:53.530 --> 00:23:56.860
August Guidan, one of Glemy's men,
joined up with the Blue Corps...

00:23:56.860 --> 00:24:00.370
and decided to turn the city
of Ghardaïa into his own base.

00:24:00.370 --> 00:24:03.950
Of course, that means
we've got to save the city!

00:24:04.150 --> 00:24:07.500
Next time on Gundam ZZ: "Blue Team."

00:24:05.710 --> 00:24:08.830
Next Time

00:24:05.710 --> 00:24:08.830
BLUE TEAM

00:24:05.710 --> 00:24:08.830
(Part 2)

00:24:08.160 --> 00:24:11.510
Ask Roux about that weird artist!
